(3, 'Glycolic Gloss Shine Sealing Conditioner 340ml', 'Discover L’Oréal Paris Elvive Glycolic Gloss Shine Sealing Conditioner, a next‑generation shine solution designed to transform dull, lifeless hair. This shine‑enhancing conditioner from our Glycolic Gloss range smooths and softens the hair, penetrating the hair fibre to reveal visibly healthy and shinier hair.\r\n\r\nInspired by advanced skin care, the formula is enriched with Glycolic Acid, known for its smoothing and resurfacing benefits. It instantly refines the hair fibre, helping to reduce frizz, boost silkiness and deliver up to 3x mirror‑like shine* - without weighing the hair down.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a refreshing, long‑lasting fragrance featuring vibrant notes of grapefruit, jasmine and cedarwood, elevating your daily wash routine.\r\nSuitable for all hair types and textures, this conditioner for dull hair delivers instant luminosity, healthier‑looking hair and next‑level shine from the very first use.\r\n\r\nWith regular use, the Elvive glycolic acid hair conditioner provides:\r\n• Instant glossy finish\r\n• Up to 3X mirror shine*\r\n• Smoothed hair fibre while maintaining a weightless feel\r\n• Softer and healthier-looking hair\r\n\r\n\r\n*Instrumental test after application of shampoo + conditioner.', 3000.00, NULL, 'products/YnGfbP6eD0YVPrdtMjgYOvqgSKvIzRDYbRlU5qOh.webp', 'hair', 1000, NULL, 1, '2026-04-08 07:27:13', '2026-07-05 05:48:11'),
(4, 'Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Sealing Conditioner for Dehydrated Hair-175ml', 'L\'Oreal Paris Hyaluron Moisture 72H Moisture Sealing Conditioner for Dehydrated Hair- 175ml\r\n\r\nSpecifications\r\nConcerns\r\nFrizz Control, Thinning and Hair Fall\r\nFormulation\r\nLotion\r\nHair Types\r\nNormal\r\nKey Ingredients\r\nHyaluronic Acid\r\nNet Quantity Unit\r\nml\r\nPreferences\r\nParaben-Free\r\nSustainable\r\nRegular', 234.00, NULL, 'products/4jIqfudh2lJnGCBxqSwkTuJkcu2vdWTeYdDsGgJ2.jpg', 'hair', 999, NULL, 1, '2026-04-08 07:28:46', '2026-04-08 20:50:29');

